# ─── OS and editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ─── Private working material ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Anything kept locally for the maintainers' own reference and never meant
# to be published.
private/
notes/
scratch/
*.private.md

# ─── Firmware and device data — MUST NOT be committed ─────────────────
# This repository documents methods only. Flash dumps, firmware images and
# unpacked filesystems belong to the vendor. They are blocked here by
# extension so they cannot be added by accident — a `git add .` in a working
# folder that also holds a dump is exactly how these things leak.
#
# Documentation images (.jpg / .png) are not affected by any rule below.
*.bin
*.img
*.jar
*.apk
*.vdex
*.odex
*.art
*.dex
*.smali
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Unpacked firmware and dump folders, whatever they get named
*_DUMP/
*_dump/
extractedRootFS/
ORI/
MOD/
dump.bin
